[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0316","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0316.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0495","title":"CSSearch csSearch 2.3 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"tags.<value>csSearch 2.3 及更早版本中的 csSearch.cgi 脚本存在代码注入漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过发送包含 savesetup 命令和 setup 参数的特制 HTTP 请求，将任意 Perl 代码写入 setup.cgi 配置文件。由于 csSearch.cgi 在处理请求时会加载该配置文件，攻击者注入的代码将在服务器端以 Web 服务权限执行，最终导致完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响所有使用 csSearch 2.3 及更早版本的网站，CVSS 评分为满分 10.0，危害等级为严重。攻击者可通过此漏洞获取服务器权限、篡改网站内容或进一步渗透内网。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0495"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:33Z","remediation":"建议将 csSearch 升级至 2.31 或更高版本（厂商已发布补丁修复 savesetup 命令对 setup 参数的代码注入漏洞）。升级后，验证 /cgi-bin/csSearch.cgi 不再接受 savesetup 命令写入 setup.cgi 配置文件。若暂时无法升级，应从 Web 服务器中移除 csSearch.cgi 及其相关文件，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 Require local）限制仅本地访问该 CGI 脚本。同时，检查服务器上的 setup.cgi 文件权限，移除 Web 服务器进程对其的写入权限，防止被远程覆盖写入恶意 Perl 代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cgiscript.net/cgi-script/csNews/csNews.cgi?database=cgi.db&command=viewone&id=7","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8636.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/264169","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4368","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21354","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0495.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0495.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0495","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0495.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0495.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7d8bf94237358a026e3c7caf39c1fffcde5864d7/2002/CVE-2002-0495.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0495.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0495.json","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2002-0495.yml","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0495.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0316.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0315","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0492","title":"DCscripts DCShop 1.002 Beta 空字节注入任意文件删除漏洞","description":"DCShop 1.002 Beta 的 dcshop.cgi 存在空字节注入漏洞，远程攻击者可在 database 参数中注入空字符（\\0），绕过文件路径校验并删除任意设置文件。该漏洞影响 DCShop 1.002 Beta 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N），属于部分完整性影响漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，通过构造包含空字符的 database 参数请求 dcshop.cgi，即可删除服务器上的任意设置文件，导致配置破坏或服务拒绝。攻击条件为网络可达且无需认证，攻击复杂度低。官方已停止维护，建议升级至修复版本或迁移至其他电商系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0492"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:32Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 DCShop 官方发布的最新修复版本（若已停止维护建议迁移至成熟电商系统），或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）配置规则拦截 database 参数中的空字符（%00），同时设置 setup 目录及其文件为只读权限（chmod 444），并禁用 dcshop.cgi 中不必要的文件删除功能。若无法升级，建议部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 %00 的请求参数，并限制 Web 服务器进程对 setup 目录的写入权限。立即部署 Web 应用防火墙规则拦截 database 参数中的空字节注入，并将 setup 目录权限设为只读（chmod 555）防止文件被删除，建议尽快迁移至维护中的电商系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0302.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21352","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0492.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0492.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0492","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0492.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0492.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0492.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6ba74bc52475414675b84b57eb9d6c639a40271d/2002/CVE-2002-0492.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0492.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/72cbdcf5b0040806853b9597e1a625651c5a1bf9/api/2002/CVE-2002-0492.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0492.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0312","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0312.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0486","title":"Intellisol Xpede 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"Intellisol Xpede（原名 WorkforceROI Xpede）4.1 及 7.0 版本存在弱密码加密漏洞。认证信息在存入 Cookie 时使用了安全性不足的加密算法，攻击者可通过物理接触目标机器、网络嗅探或跨站脚本攻击等方式获取 Cookie 中的加密凭据，并利用弱加密算法的可逆向性解密出明文密码，从而获取系统敏感权限。该漏洞允许本地或具有 Cookie 访问权限的攻击者实现权限提升，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0486"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:32Z","remediation":"立即升级 WorkforceROI Xpede 至厂商提供的最新补丁版本。如已无官方支持，建议迁移至其他支持强加密认证机制的替代产品；如必须继续使用，须将 Web 服务器配置为启用 HTTPS 并启用安全 cookie 属性（Secure+HttpOnly），同时在服务器端会话中存储认证状态而非在 cookie 中存放明文/弱加密凭据。另外应立即通知所有用户修改密码，并在操作系统层面限制对 cookie 文件目录（如 `c:\\winnt\\Profiles\\*\\Cookies\\*@*.txt`）的访问权限，仅允许最小必要用户可读。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/263485","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4344","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/8614","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21351","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0486.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0486.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0486","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0486.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0486.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2002/CVE-2002-0486.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0486.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0486.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0486.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0486.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0312.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0311","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0311.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0484","title":"PHP move_uploaded_file open_basedir 绕过漏洞","description":"PHP 3.0.x 及 4.x 版本中的 move_uploaded_file 函数在处理文件上传时未对 open_basedir 配置指令进行检查，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞绕过目录限制，将上传文件写入系统上的任意目录，破坏文件系统完整性并可能导致进一步的攻击利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0484"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:32Z","remediation":"升级 PHP 至 4.2.0 或更高版本（该版本已为 move_uploaded_file 添加 open_basedir 检查）；如无法升级，在 php.ini 中设置 open_basedir 限制可访问目录范围，并启用 safe_mode 作为深度防御。同时避免向不可信用户开放文件上传功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.php.net/bug.php?id=16128","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101683938806677&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/262999","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/263259","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8591.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4325","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21347","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0484.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0484","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0484.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0484.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/3e6ed1a1d75816367e38c59309d8bdc19a3733f1/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0484.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0aa53285166fed6b300b29cf483b59e9c54d85d6/2002/CVE-2002-0484.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0484.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0484.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0484.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2002-0484.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0311.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0311.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0311.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0310","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0310.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0483","title":"PHP-Nuke 5.x 错误消息Web根目录泄露漏洞","description":"CVE-2002-0483是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0483"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:31Z","remediation":"立即将 PHP-Nuke 升级至 5.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 index.php 中的路径泄露问题。同时，在 php.ini 或 .htaccess 中设置 display_errors = Off 并将 log_errors 设为 On，将错误信息写入服务器日志而非直接显示给客户端，从而阻止攻击者通过错误消息获取 Web 根目录物理路径。如暂时无法升级，可在 Apache 或 Nginx 中配置自定义 404 错误页面，屏蔽 PHP 脚本的输出。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/263337","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8618.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4333","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21349","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c61100b82badca16ad107892eaf1ce53a00c3776/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0483.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0483","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7ebe16a87d7482b578f5baf29517e74408f62ab5/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0483.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0483.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0483.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e360b144e9e9de9c01917f4eb9026f28ed6b0719/2002/CVE-2002-0483.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/add116086810bb7d1683fe817918d7cb8b023671/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0483.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5a7f3ccb6b354d61d4323083fa9c1d84dcae305b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0483.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0483.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0483.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0309","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0468","title":"Ecartis 多个本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Ecartis（曾用名 Listar）1.0.0 及此前版本（2002年4月27日快照版）存在多个本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过向程序传递过长的命令行参数，利用 core.c 中未正确处理输入的问题，或通过在 moderate.c、lcgi.c、fileapi.c、cookie.c、codes.c 等文件中滥用 sprintf() 函数，触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取本地特权提升。该漏洞影响使用 Ecartis 邮件列表管理系统的服务器，CVSS 评分为 4.6，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0468"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:30Z","remediation":"由于 Ecartis（原名 Listar）已停止维护且无官方补丁发布，建议立即迁移至仍在维护的邮件列表管理软件（如 GNU Mailman 或 majordomo）并禁用 Ecartis 服务。如暂无法完成迁移，应立即对所有源代码中不安全的 sprintf() 调用进行替换修复：在 core.c、moderate.c、lcgi.c、fileapi.c、cookie.c、codes.c 等文件中，将所有 sprintf() 改为 snprintf() 并明确指定缓冲区大小，在 COMMAND_LINE_ARG_MAX 处对传入的命令行参数进行长度校验，限制最大输入长度为 512 字节。同时以非特权用户「listar」身份运行，禁止以 root 身份执行 ecartis 二进制文件；对 ecartis 安装目录及可执行文件设置最小权限（仅 listar 用户可读写执行），编译时添加 -fstack-protector-all -D_FORTIFY_SOURCE=2 编译选项启用栈保护，并在操作系统层面开启 ASLR 随机化内存布局以增加利用难度。长期解决方案为彻底替换为受持续安全更新的邮件列表管理平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=listar-support&m=101590272221720&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/269658","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/269879","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/82/258763","http://www.ecartis.org/","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8445.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/261209","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4271","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21342","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/761c156ad3eda85b7d2b67fee400e658dfbee229/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0468.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0468","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/47ec74f5faf5543ca791f6a1af1c075a0176bd75/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0468.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0468.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/90636c5eb0ebf4fb8d7f6d8c1464f65a217dc73b/2002/CVE-2002-0468.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0468.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/cf33bcd8c9c3dd9716057ebbaa91c4242d5c116d/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0468.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0468.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0468.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2002-0468.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0307","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0307.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0461","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer / Mozilla / Opera 浏览器 JavaScript 解释器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"该漏洞源于多种浏览器（如 Internet Explorer 5.01 至 6、Mozilla 0.8/0.9.x 及 Opera 5/6）的 JavaScript 解释器在处理特定脚本时存在逻辑缺陷。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问包含特制 JavaScript 代码的网页，利用 `location.replace` 方法在页面自身上循环调用，从而触发无限递归循环。这种机制会导致浏览器资源耗尽或解释器崩溃，最终导致应用程序拒绝服务（DoS），使受害者无法正常浏览网页。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0461"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:29Z","remediation":"建议将 Internet Explorer 5/6、Mozilla 0.8/0.9.x 以及 Opera 5/6 升级到厂商发布的最新版本以修复 JavaScript 解释器逻辑缺陷。对于无法立即升级的受影响系统，可以通过在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 执行来临时缓解该拒绝服务漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/262994","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8488.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4322","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21346","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0461.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0461","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/041916a4bbe5f9cbf864643dca3b8c710245f3cd/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0461.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0461.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0461.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/98f78a3416723dbfe56c27c011c6c9fcb654559d/2002/CVE-2002-0461.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f70d5f67d882c6b7234765d7d282f3eabd0bde73/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0461.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/587bea69d167e460a23a9be6f3ca8e8e579b31db/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0461.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0461.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0461.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0307.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0307.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0307.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0306","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0454","title":"Qualcomm QPopper 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Qualcomm QPopper 4.0.3 及更早版本中存在一个拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞的原理是程序在处理输入字符串时缺乏足够的长度校验，当远程攻击者发送一个超长字符串时，会导致系统陷入死循环，从而造成 CPU 资源耗尽。由于该漏洞可通过网络远程触发且无需身份验证，攻击者可轻易导致服务崩溃或系统响应缓慢。该漏洞影响 QPopper 4.0.x 系列版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0454"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:28Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Qpopper 至 4.0.4 或更高版本以修复死循环逻辑。由于该产品已过时，建议迁移至更为安全的现代邮件推送替代方案，或在前端部署防火墙/WAF 限制输入字符串的最大长度，以缓解拒绝服务攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8458.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/262213","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4295","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21345","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b55a0e6faed5f81ed4c75a7b8a6ed2ea8e5965a3/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0454.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/093c5941fc87f5111705731d4067bd31fc64fcb1/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0454.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0454","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0454.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0454.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/69f765b890d6a7ba9619723b83004b4c02c80271/2002/CVE-2002-0454.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f70d5f67d882c6b7234765d7d282f3eabd0bde73/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0454.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3ff6beb83d6269b250baa3883409b203119d8277/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0454.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0454.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0454.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0305","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0305.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0451","title":"PHProjekt 3.1 远程文件包含漏洞","description":"PHProjekt 3.1 和 3.1a 版本中的 filemanager_forms.php 文件存在远程文件包含漏洞。由于 lib_path 参数未经过滤直接引入外部文件，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过构造恶意 URL 并传入该参数，远程包含并执行任意 PHP 代码。该漏洞影响使用 PHProjekt 3.1/3.1a 版本的项目管理系统的用户，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在目标服务器上执行恶意脚本，可能导致服务器被完全控制、敏感数据泄露或进一步内网渗透。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0451"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:28Z","remediation":"建议将 PHProjekt 升级至 3.2 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。若无法立即升级，应在 php.ini 配置文件中将 allow_url_include 选项设置为 Off，以禁止远程文件包含，并对 filemanager_forms.php 中的 lib_path 参数实施严格的白名单校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8448.php","http://www.phprojekt.com/modules.php?op=modload&name=News&file=article&sid=19&mode=&order=","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/261676","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4284","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21343","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2006/CVE-2006-5123.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c97d5ffdc5a2cf56b1acb2dd5f27977ef5ef9b47/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0451.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/966d6acc4d3db576e6440ff8f64cc85a59a26a1a/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0451.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0451","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0451.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0451.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3fc3652d507c8d53c7bd6968930aebc4bd12c458/2002/CVE-2002-0451.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1c98b2d8acf89a4fc8ad5003e9f3d9e7efbc65a9/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0451.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3ff6beb83d6269b250baa3883409b203119d8277/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0451.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0451.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0305.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0295","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0295.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0430","title":"Sun Cobalt RaQ XTR 身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Sun Cobalt RaQ XTR 2.0/3.0/4.0 管理界面中的 MultiFileUploadHandler.php 组件存在身份认证绕过漏洞。攻击者可通过在系统上创建本地符号链接指向临时文件，随后请求 MultiFileUpload.php 接口，利用符号链接攻击绕过身份验证机制，从而实现对任意文件的覆盖写入。该漏洞影响 Cobalt RaQ XTR 相关版本，攻击者需具备本地用户权限且能通过符号链接操纵文件系统，可导致系统配置被篡改或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0430"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:25Z","remediation":"由于 Cobalt RaQ XTR 及其相关版本（2.0/3.0/4.0）已停止维护，建议通过禁用或删除管理接口中的 MultiFileUpload.php 脚本来消除风险。若必须使用，应将 Web 服务器运行权限限制为最低，并禁用系统层面的符号链接创建权限，防止攻击者通过 symlink 覆盖系统关键文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-03/0081.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4252","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21335","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0430.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0430.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0430","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0430.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0430.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0430.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7330b0580e3b5cfcde14ca2a28aa1774cbe1d7d1/2002/CVE-2002-0430.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0430.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0430.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0430.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0295.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0294","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0294.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0419","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0/5.1 身份认证方法信息泄漏漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0/5.1 版本在处理身份认证请求时存在信息泄露漏洞。漏洞原理为服务器在响应认证请求时，会在特定配置下通过 Basic 认证的 realm 字段泄露被 NAT 掩盖的服务器真实 IP 地址，或在 NTLM 认证响应中泄露服务器的 NetBIOS 名称及 Windows NT 域信息。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过发送特制的认证请求即可触发该漏洞，从而获取目标系统的敏感网络配置信息，为后续的内网渗透或暴力破解提供关键线索。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0419"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:24Z","remediation":"建议将 IIS 4.0/5.0/5.1 升级至 Windows Server 2003 或更高版本的 IIS 6.0 及以上版本。若无法升级，可通过配置反向代理服务器（如 Nginx/Apache）拦截并删除响应头中的敏感 Realm 信息，或在防火墙层面限制对管理接口的访问以缓解信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101535399100534&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8382.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4235","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21313","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2002/CVE-2002-0419.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0419.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0419","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0419.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0419.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0419.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0419.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/aec583eb63efdf87c22d75a68cbfc56a570b19f7/2002/CVE-2002-0419.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0419.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0419.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0294.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0293","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0293.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0413","title":"ReBB 1.0 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"ReBB 1.0 版本中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞的原理是程序未能对用户输入的 HTML 标签进行严格过滤，导致攻击者可以通过在 `<img>` 标签的 URL 属性中嵌入恶意 JavaScript 脚本来触发漏洞。远程攻击者只需诱导用户访问包含该恶意标签的页面，即可在用户浏览器中执行任意 JS 代码，从而窃取用户的会话 Cookie 或进行其他恶意操作。该漏洞影响 ReBB 1.0 版本，攻击条件为无需身份认证的远程触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0413"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:23Z","remediation":"建议停止使用已过时的 ReBB 1.0 版本，迁移至现代安全的论坛系统。如必须维持运行，需修改源代码中处理 IMG 标签的解析函数，对 URL 属性进行严格的白名单过滤或 HTML 实体编码，禁止在 URL 路径中包含脚本执行关键字或特殊字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/259464","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8353.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4220","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21312","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0da25b98d7bcc33832f1568bdeed8ba3a55a37d8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0413.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0413.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0413","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0413.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0413.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ee105ce6a7ae3dcfdca731c9e0103720070344c0/2002/CVE-2002-0413.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/42f7ce3fe01d1b8b4a37ed409361811a74eb1f5b/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-04xx/CVE-2002-0413.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f4cffac67804f46d22292c2f69fa529dc186f5dd/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0413.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0413.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0413.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0293.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0273","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0273.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0846","title":"Macromedia Shockwave Flash 代码执行漏洞","description":"Macromedia Shockwave Flash 解码器存在边界检查漏洞，当解码器遇到具有恶意 SWF 文件头部的文件时，由于头部指定的数据长度不足以包含后续的实际数据，它会允许读取超出缓冲区范围的数据，从而引发整数溢出或缓冲区溢出漏洞。该漏洞影响所有安装了 Flash Player 的用户，攻击者可远程发送特制的 SWF 文件无需认证即可触发，导致攻击者在用户权限下执行任意代码，破坏系统的完整性、机密性和可用性，安全风险极高，已确认存在相关的攻击利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0846"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:15Z","remediation":"立即安装 Adobe Shockwave Flash 6 Update 3 或更高版本（包含安全修复），或将 Flash 升级到 7.x 系列并应用 2002 年 8 月安全补丁，如无法立即更新，可通过浏览器禁用 Flash 插件并限制 SWF 文件加载以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103072708329280&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9798.php","http://www.macromedia.com/v1/handlers/index.cfm?ID=23293","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-026.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-027.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5430","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0846.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0846.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0846","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0846.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0846.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cf9f26fab3bbc76af663e922f8ccf4da465b1866/2002/CVE-2002-0846.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0846.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0846.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0846.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0846.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0273.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0257","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0257.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0822","title":"Ethereal 多协议解析器远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ethereal（即后来的Wireshark）0.9.4及更早版本中的SOCKS、RSVP、AFS和LMP协议解析器存在安全缺陷。未经认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形网络数据包，触发这些协议解析器发生核心转储（core dump），导致Ethereal进程崩溃从而引发拒绝服务。在特定条件下，攻击者可能利用解析器处理异常数据时的内存错误执行任意代码。该漏洞影响Ethereal 0.9.4及之前所有版本，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0822"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:12Z","remediation":"立即将 Ethereal 升级至 0.9.5 或更高版本（Debian 系统安装 ethereal 0.9.4-1woody1 及以上版本）。该软件已更名为 Wireshark，建议迁移至最新版 Wireshark 4.x 系列以获得长期安全支持。如无法升级，可在防火墙规则中禁用对受影响端口（SOCKS 1080、RSVP 等）的未授权访问作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ethereal.com/appnotes/enpa-sa-00005.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5167","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0822.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c5b23a2286aa84c456bf6f6d110b03c6adf1961/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0822.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0822","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0822.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0822.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/10137f1f09105a4ed85d5f8d438eb1a3ac38b0e8/2002/CVE-2002-0822.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0822.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0822.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0822.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0822.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_u